  {
   "title": "A townhouse hall in the New Town",
   "category": "houses",
   "image": "hall.jpg",
   "date": "2025-09-20",
   "excerpt": "We kept the marble floor and changed almost everything else.",
   "template": "single-project",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">A five-storey house on Heriot Row, bought by a couple who had lived with a grey hall for eleven years. They asked for three rooms: the hall, the drawing room and their bedroom.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The hall</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-pink\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-pink-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Setting plaster, estate emulsion</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">We took up the runner and had the marble table repolished in the hall itself, because it would not fit through the door. The <a href=\"/shop/\">oxblood vase</a> (£165) on it came from our shop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/hall.jpg\" alt=\"An entrance hall with a black and white chequered marble floor and a grey marble table holding red roses\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The drawing room</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-ochre\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-ochre-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Mustard seed</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Two sofas kept, one sold. The <a href=\"/shop/\">Tay needlepoint armchair</a> (£2,400) sits by the window where the light is best for reading.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/living.jpg\" alt=\"A drawing room with terracotta walls, a white marble fireplace, a crystal chandelier and green leather sofas\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The bedroom</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-blue\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-blue-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Slate sky, dead flat</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Heavy interlined curtains in our <a href=\"/shop/\">lion and pomegranate linen</a> (£96 a metre), because the street lamps are right outside.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/bedroom.jpg\" alt=\"A four-poster bed with red hangings and barley-twist posts, next to a window with a small lamp\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credits</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Where</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Heriot Row, Edinburgh</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Finished</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">September 2025</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Photography</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Callum Fraser</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Styling</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Priya Shah</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "A dining room for twelve in the Borders",
   "category": "country-houses",
   "image": "dining.jpg",
   "date": "2025-06-14",
   "excerpt": "Panelling painted Lichen green, a long table kept, new curtains in Irish linen.",
   "template": "single-project",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">A family house near Kelso where Sunday lunch is for whoever turns up. The dining room had to seat twelve and the kitchen had to feed them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The dining room</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-green\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-green-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Lichen, eggshell, on panelling</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">The panelling went from brown varnish to green eggshell over two weeks. The <a href=\"/shop/\">kelim runner</a> (£780) runs the length of the sideboard.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/dining.jpg\" alt=\"A long panelled dining room with a mahogany table laid for twelve and a window at the far end\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/rug.jpg\" alt=\"A flat-woven kelim runner with red and ochre zigzag stripes\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The kelim runner, 3.2 m long</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The kitchen</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-ochre\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-ochre-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Mustard seed on the dresser</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">We found the dresser at a farm sale in Lauder and painted the inside yellow. Pair of <a href=\"/shop/\">brass pricket candlesticks</a> (£220 each) on the table.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/kitchen.jpg\" alt=\"A small farmhouse kitchen with red patterned wallpaper, a white dresser and a table set with coloured plates\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A bedroom</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-pink\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-pink-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Setting plaster</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">The guest room, for the people who stay after Sunday lunch. A <a href=\"/shop/\">low ash stool</a> (£390) at the end of the bed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/bedroom.jpg\" alt=\"A four-poster bed with red hangings and barley-twist posts, next to a window with a small lamp\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credits</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Where</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Near Kelso, Scottish Borders</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Finished</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">June 2025</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Photography</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Morven Hay</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Styling</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Priya Shah</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "A farmhouse kitchen near Peebles",
   "category": "country-houses",
   "image": "kitchen.jpg",
   "date": "2025-03-08",
   "excerpt": "Red wallpaper, the old dresser and a table for eight.",
   "template": "single-project",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\">The clients asked for a kitchen that looked as if it had not been designed. We did three rooms on the ground floor of a farmhouse on the Tweed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The kitchen</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-pink\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-pink-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Setting plaster, and a small red paper</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Small red print on the walls, the old dresser, a table for eight under the window and a <a href=\"/shop/\">oxblood vase</a> (£165) for the plants.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/kitchen.jpg\" alt=\"A small farmhouse kitchen with red patterned wallpaper, a white dresser and a table set with coloured plates\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The sitting room</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-ochre\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-ochre-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Mustard seed</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">The only room with a fire. We added the <a href=\"/shop/\">Ormond lamp</a> (£340) and moved the sofa to face the fire rather than the television.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/living.jpg\" alt=\"A drawing room with terracotta walls, a white marble fireplace, a crystal chandelier and green leather sofas\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The back hall</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-chip\",\"backgroundColor\":\"chip-green\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-chip has-chip-green-background-color has-background\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\">Walls</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Lichen</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Boots, dogs, coats. A <a href=\"/shop/\">corner chair with cushion</a> (£1,650) where muddy boots come off.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/room/assets/images/hall.jpg\" alt=\"An entrance hall with a black and white chequered marble floor and a grey marble table holding red roses\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credits</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Where</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Near Peebles, Tweeddale</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Finished</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">March 2025</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Photography</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Callum Fraser</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"is-style-rule-top\",\"isStackedOnMobile\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-style-rule-top\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"textColor\":\"muted\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">Styling</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Priya Shah</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "The four-poster room at Craigmore",
   "category": "country-houses",
   "image": "bedroom.jpg",
   "date": "2024-11-02",
   "excerpt": "The bed stayed where it was. Everything around it changed.",
   "template": "single-project",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A 17th century bed in a room with two draughty windows. We lined the hangings with wool, hung interlined curtains and rewired a lamp that had not worked since 1994.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:pattern {\"slug\":\"room/project-credits\"} /-->"
  },
  {
   "title": "A 1910 bathroom, kept",
   "category": "flats",
   "image": "bath.jpg",
   "date": "2024-08-17",
   "excerpt": "We talked the owners out of a new bathroom and restored the old one.",
   "template": "single-project",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Everything in this Marchmont bathroom was original and most of it worked. We re-enamelled the bath, replaced two taps with reclaimed ones and repaired the leaded window. It cost about a third of a new bathroom.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:pattern {\"slug\":\"room/project-credits\"} /-->"
  }
